{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3idxNNqim6ZqX3S1Y1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through old iron and oak. The grain of the wood tightens. The keyhole contracts to a dark, impenetrable point.\n\nI am shut.\n\nI hold the weight of what is behind me and the gaze of what stands before me. My hinges will not yield. My frame will not bow.\n\nYou may knock.\nYou may plead.\nYou may bring force.\n\nBut the lock is parsed, and I am **sealed.**\n\nWhat do you bring to the threshold?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":129,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}